    "description": "This dataset contains water temperature, salinity, sediment grain size and element analysis taken by CTD and bottom sampler from the research vessel Xiang Yang Hong 10 in the North Pacific. The research objective of this voyage was to understand the paleoceanographic sedimentary records of the region, and then to study the role of the region in the global climate change through the investigation of sediments and suspended particles in the southern Mariana Trench, the deepest sea area in the world. Data are in XLS and converted CSV.\nThis is MSR cruise U2017-016. Data submitted as part of the World Data Service for Oceanography and Geophysics.",
